# label: alg:ch73-callback
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch73.tex:80
# caption: Visit indices with a synchronous status-returning callback.

REQUIRE bounded count n, rooted callable, attached runtime thread, writable output
ENSURE full sum on success; output unchanged on failure
validate 0 <= n <= 10,000; s <- 0
FOR i=0 to n-1 DO
  invoke callback through its runtime error boundary
  IF callback failed or result is outside int32 range THEN
    return callback failure without publishing s
  END IF
  s <- s+callback result
END FOR
publish s; return success

